2.1.2.1 Distribution of the Ethnic Groups over the Entire Country
Table 2.4 presents the first dimension, and is based on the percentage distribution of the
ethnic/nationality groups of the population with reference to the country as a whole. The intention
is to demonstrate how the groups are proportionally spread over the entire country in order to
provide statistical evidence on the heterogeneous nature of the population as earlier put forward.
At a glance, the heterogeneity of the national population could be clearly seen, for it is evident
from the table that persons belonging to every ethnic group are found in every one of the ten
administrative regions in proportion to their respective total size.
